  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nThe pusher has a problem while pushing notifies to Gotify. Partially a few notifies coming through but always these exceptions. Gotify to Web and Mobile Clients works fine and wget sending messages too.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- \r\n- Homeserver running Synapse 1.24.0 and Postgres on FreeBSD 12.2\r\n- Gotify from today with Matrix Plugin using SQLite on Extra FreeBSD 12.2 Server\r\n\r\n\r\n### Log\r\n```\r\n2020-12-17 19:05:19,833 - synapse.http.client - 410 - INFO - httppush.process-12 - Received response to POST https://gotify.mydom.com:63555/plugin/2/custom/P_E7Q236437820sAEpm/hook: 200\r\n2020-12-17 19:05:19,835 - synapse.push.httppusher - 177 - ERROR - httppush.process-12 - Exception processing notifs\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/usr/home/synapse/env/lib/python3.6/site-packages/synapse/push/httppusher.py\", line 175, in _process\r\n    await self._unsafe_process()\r\n  File \"/usr/home/synapse/env/lib/python3.6/site-packages/synapse/push/httppusher.py\", line 213, in _unsafe_process\r\n    processed = await self._process_one(push_action)\r\n  File \"/usr/home/synapse/env/lib/python3.6/site-packages/synapse/push/httppusher.py\", line 300, in _process_one\r\n    rejected = await self.dispatch_push(event, tweaks, badge)\r\n  File \"/usr/home/synapse/env/lib/python3.6/site-packages/synapse/push/httppusher.py\", line 408, in dispatch_push\r\n    rejected = resp[\"rejected\"]\r\nTypeError: string indices must be integers\r\n```\r\nI do not want to publish different URL's here, but if somebody wants a test account on the Gotify Server, let me know.",
